{"id":36837968105,"name":"Run api tests","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAIk7bI6Q","head_branch":"fix/orgunit-associations-patharray","head_sha":"66791f861decb18ba4b644dbfd5b8b95e357e8a8","path":".github/workflows/run-api-tests.yml","run_number":53285,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"perf: restrict org unit associations join to the user hierarchy","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":5591308,"check_suite_id":99773969431,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAXOv30Fw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/36837968105","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/36837968105","pull_requests":[{"id":4700762414,"number":25459,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/pulls/25459","head":{"ref":"fix/orgunit-associations-patharray","sha":"66791f861decb18ba4b644dbfd5b8b95e357e8a8","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}},"base":{"ref":"master","sha":"bc578e37c0406d0f0ddf84ef87352e6f52a02aac","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}}}],"created_at":"2026-10-01T08:42:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T08:54:49Z","run_started_at":"2026-10-01T08:42:10Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/36837968105/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/36837968105/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/99773969431","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/36837968105/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/36837968105/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/36837968105/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"perf: restrict org unit associations join to the user hierarchy\n\nFor non-superusers the org unit associations query joined every\nassociated org unit and only then filtered out those outside the user's\nhierarchy. As the filter (on the nullable side of a left join, combined\nwith \"is null\") was applied after the join, no index could be used: a\ndata set assigned to 105k org units took ~500ms for a user with a\nsingle org unit, regardless of path LIKE or patharray containment.\n\nMove the hierarchy condition into the org unit join, so Postgres can\nstart from the user's subtree via the GIN index on patharray and only\nlook up those org units' associations. Use the overlap operator with\nonly the UIDs of the user org units, rather than containment of their\nfull paths. Objects without any associated org units are still\nreturned, and objects with all org units outside the hierarchy are\nstill omitted.\n\nMeasured on a production database: ~505ms down to ~1.6ms.\n\nAdd a Postgres integration test pinning the behaviour, verified to pass\nagainst the previous query as well.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"66791f861decb18ba4b644dbfd5b8b95e357e8a8","tree_id":"f2e3d69008b0502cb93caca5922d9b8d74116077","timestamp":"2026-10-01T08:35:28Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","